IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Mi dispiace averti disturbato,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
